As I said,

> But there seems to be something wrong, as you mention 7065 markers but the output of read.cross says 7064 individuals but 192 markers. Maybe use format=“csvr”.

format “csv” is for the case that columns=phenotypes and markers and rows=individuals. format “csvr” is for the case that rows=phenotypes and markers and columns=individuals.

karl

